From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:37:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter/vf_tonemap_vulkan: add the bt2408_hable tone map

Add a Vulkan compute filter that runs the bt2408_hable tone map of the
CPU tonemap filter. The host fills the shared FFBT2408Hable state and
uploads it as a storage buffer when the peak or the primaries change,
after the queued work has finished. The shader in
vulkan/bt2408_hable.comp.glsl ports the per-pixel part of
opencl/bt2408_hable.cl.

The filter takes P010 frames with PQ transfer and BT.2020 limited range,
refuses other input with an error, and writes BT.709 limited range NV12
or P010. Light-level and mastering-display side data are removed from
the output.

Signed-off-by: lusoris <lusoris@proton.me>
